## Frontend environment variables
#
# Local development (recommended):
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000
#
# If you leave NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL unset, the frontend calls relative `/api/*`
# and Next.js proxies those to http://localhost:5000 (see next.config.js).
# Socket.io still needs a reachable host — prefer setting the URL above for local realtime.
#
# Production / hosted backend:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com

